{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1011781-tale-of-two-worlds-of-darkness-or-basically-would-there-ever-be-any-offical-crossover-material-with-wod-and-cofd","id":1011781,"title":"Tale of Two Worlds of Darkness: Or basically would there ever be any offical crossover material with WoD and CofD?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-03T18:55:10-08:00","id":1011781,"title":"Tale of Two Worlds of Darkness: Or basically would there ever be any offical crossover material with WoD and CofD?","content":"Is there any planned official material from Oynxpath or White Wolf of a WoD and CoD crossover and somehow tie it in to the God Machine chronicles?<br /> <br /> I think it would be interesting especially if you have CoD characters travel to the WoD or vice versa or somehow merge the two worlds together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","name":"Veindark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T19:02:11-08:00","id":1011783,"title":"","content":"The Translation Guides and that's pretty much it as far as it goes now.<br /> <br /> It's weird to try and tie two different games together, but that's not to say it's impossible. I imagine the most it'd be is sidebar story hooks though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T19:12:52-08:00","id":1011786,"title":"","content":"I'd be hard-pressed to imagine a product I want to see less. Not everything needs to be a superhero mashup, and on top of that many choices in CofD were deliberate reactions to the mistakes of WoD or rebukes of the choices it made; smashing them together misses the point of that progression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T20:17:55-08:00","id":1011811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1011781-tale-of-two-worlds-of-darkness-or-basically-would-there-ever-be-any-offical-crossover-material-with-wod-and-cofd?p=1011786#post1011786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be hard-pressed to imagine a product I want to see less.</div> </div> </div> </div>And based on White Wolf's attitude towards CofD, it seems like they would feel the same way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T20:21:28-08:00","id":1011814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1011781-tale-of-two-worlds-of-darkness-or-basically-would-there-ever-be-any-offical-crossover-material-with-wod-and-cofd?p=1011811#post1011811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And based on White Wolf's attitude towards CofD, it seems like they would feel the same way.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure I want Martin anywhere near CofD, honestly. He hasn't said much that's given me a ton of confidence in his new direction for WoD and if less support is the price the games I prefer anyway pay for him not meddling, I'm okay with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://fo